Changes relative to HAPI, starting 2026-08: a task list whose tasks move
through their states on their own as their agents work (hub task
orchestration, task store and API, web task list), a git worktree and pull
request per task, scheduled runs, a per-person task assistant, workspace
users for shared hubs, and related fixes across the CLI, hub and web
packages. dugong ships the web app (a PWA) only; HAPI's native iOS and
Android apps are removed. The full list of changes is the git history after
the fork point; docs/divergence.md summarizes it.
